{"slug":"gh-y-b","ar":"غ ي ب","total":60,"core":"the unseen; absence","forms":[{"ar":"غَيْب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":49,"gloss":"The unseen","word":"ghayb","ex":{"s":13,"a":9,"p":2,"ar":["عَـٰلِمُ","ٱلْغَيْبِ","وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ","ٱلْكَبِيرُ","ٱلْمُتَعَالِ"],"en":"[He is] Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, the Grand, the Exalted"}},{"ar":"غُيُوب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"unseen things","word":null,"ex":{"s":34,"a":48,"p":7,"ar":["قُلْ","إِنَّ","رَبِّى","يَقْذِفُ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","عَلَّـٰمُ","ٱلْغُيُوبِ"],"en":"Say, \"Indeed, my Lord projects the truth. Knower of the unseen"}},{"ar":"غَآئِبِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"absent","word":null,"ex":{"s":82,"a":16,"p":4,"ar":["وَمَا","هُمْ","عَنْهَا","بِغَآئِبِينَ"],"en":"And never therefrom will they be absent"}},{"ar":"غَيَٰبَت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"depths, bottom","word":null,"ex":{"s":12,"a":10,"p":9,"ar":["قَالَ","قَآئِلٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","لَا","تَقْتُلُوا۟","يُوسُفَ","وَأَلْقُوهُ","فِى","غَيَـٰبَتِ","ٱلْجُبِّ","يَلْتَقِطْهُ","بَعْضُ","ٱلسَّيَّارَةِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","فَـٰعِلِينَ"],"en":"Said a speaker among them, \"Do not kill Joseph but throw him into the bottom of the well; some travelers will pick him up - if you would do [something]"}},{"ar":"غَآئِبَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"hidden thing","word":null,"ex":{"s":27,"a":75,"p":3,"ar":["وَمَا","مِنْ","غَآئِبَةٍ","فِى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","إِلَّا","فِى","كِتَـٰبٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"en":"And there is nothing concealed within the heaven and the earth except that it is in a clear Register"}},{"ar":"يَغْتَب","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":1,"gloss":"to backbite","word":null,"ex":{"s":49,"a":12,"p":15,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","كَثِيرًا","مِّنَ","ٱلظَّنِّ","إِنَّ","بَعْضَ","ٱلظَّنِّ","إِثْمٌ ۖ","وَلَا","تَجَسَّسُوا۟","وَلَا","يَغْتَب","بَّعْضُكُم","بَعْضًا ۚ","أَيُحِبُّ","أَحَدُكُمْ","أَن","يَأْكُلَ","لَحْمَ","أَخِ